    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cingetŏrix</span></b> , igis, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A Gaul</i>, <i>rival of his
				father-in-law Indutiomarus</i>, <i>in respect to
				dominion over the</i> Treviri, Caes B. G. 5, 3; 5, 56
			al—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A king of the region about Cantium</i>, <i>in Britain</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. G.
				5, 22</span></i>.</div>
